# The build context is the app's sources only: package files, prisma/, fixtures/, public/, src/ and the
# Next, PostCSS and TypeScript configs. Everything else slows down "load build context" or does not
# belong in an image. Patterns are relative to this folder, so they do not touch src/app/AGENTS.md/.

# Agent sessions: .claude/worktrees holds whole checkouts with their own node_modules (over 1 GB)
.claude

# Dependencies, build output and test output (the image installs and builds its own)
node_modules
.next
out
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
*.tsbuildinfo

# Version control and local state
.git
.gitignore
*.db
*.db-journal
.env*
!.env.example

# Not needed to build or run the app (compose mounts docker/ itself; scripts/ refresh fixtures from the library)
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker
docs
scripts
tests
playwright.config.ts
vitest.config.mts
AGENTS.md
README.md
